#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Cinema - Films" tvg-id="668825965" tvg-name="Philip Gale‚ a young American sailor‚ signs onto the Yorikke‚ a decrepit freighter crewed by outcasts. What begins as a quest for freedom becomes a brutal ordeal of hard labour‚ inhumane treatment‚ and grim revelations – especially when a disturbing secret is found in the ship’s cargo. A gritty seafaring tale that launched Horst Buchholz’s path to Hollywood.<br/>From 05.01.2026 23:13" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Ship of the Dead (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (05.01.2026)
