#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Culture - Arts" tvg-id="125026812" tvg-name="In literature and cinema‚ it is often the bad guys who captivate us the most. In video games‚ you can actually become them: the iconic Dark Vader (Star Wars: the Force Unleashed)‚ a violent psychopath (Man Hunt)‚ or even an immigration officer (Paper Please). Trinity and Yann Leroux plunge into the dark side of video games.<br/>From 21.11.2016 15:19" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Art of Gaming - Bad Guys (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (21.11.2016)
