#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Culture - Arts" tvg-id="1109219852" tvg-name="The 1848 revolution shakes the foundations of the monarchy. Lamartine proclaims a republic while the romantics. Dumas‚ Hugo and Sand become politically active and the courage of their convictions is tested...<br/>From 21.12.2024 21:51" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Romantics of Paris (3/4) - Twilight of the Romantics (1848-1855) (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (21.12.2024)
