#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Culture - Arts" tvg-id="1430498326" tvg-name="The quest is a key part of heroic fantasy series. In gaming‚ it becomes a means to challenge the player but also to provoke emotions and create a real immersive experience. Trinity invites Lionel Davoust (SF author) to analyse the importance of the quest through Zelda‚ The Witcher 3 and Eve Online.<br/>From 05.07.2017 17:36" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Art of Gaming - Quests (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (05.07.2017)
