#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Culture - Arts" tvg-id="773031483" tvg-name="History is a playground for game designers. Sybile Collas (Narrative designer) and Trinity go back to WW1 in Battlefield 1‚ rewrite history with Wolfenstein: The New Order‚ and discover an imagined history in Bioshock Infinite. Utopia‚ dystopia or uchrony‚ why these genres so compelling?<br/>From 05.07.2017 18:57" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Art of Gaming - Alternate History (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (05.07.2017)
