#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Culture - Arts" tvg-id="463986312" tvg-name="Video games are often full of action and face-to-face showdowns. But sometimes they can also leave the player alone with his thoughts‚ giving him or her a sensation of solitude and the space for introspection. Melek analyses the genre with three loneliness experts: an ESA astronaut trainer‚ a philosopher and a media specialist.<br/>From 27.09.2017 09:23" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Art of Gaming - Loneliness (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (27.09.2017)
