#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Culture - Pop culture" tvg-id="372169426" tvg-name="Istanbul‚ Beirut‚ Baghdad‚ Cairo. From the end of the 19th century‚ artists from the Ottoman Empire set off for Europe to learn new techniques. But this journey brought them back to their roots‚ as oriental fantasies were all the rage in Europe. Gradually they began to define their region through their own eyes and invented an alternative modernity in the process.<br/>From 18.11.2025 11:17" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",From Istanbul to Cairo: Stories of Modern Art - Journey to the West (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (18.11.2025)
