#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Discovery - Lives from afar" tvg-id="1124716015" tvg-name="The katana‚ the legendary samurai sword‚ embodies Japanese culture‚ spirituality‚ and discipline. In Yamagata‚ in the north of the country‚ a master swordsmith uses a traditional method to craft a custom-made sword over several weeks: a work steeped in symbolism that combines strength and honour.<br/>From 25.10.2025 17:30" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",360° Reportaje - Katana‚ the Legacy and Honour of the Samurai (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (25.10.2025)
