#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Discovery - Lives from afar" tvg-id="495219943" tvg-name="In Peru‚ every year‚ the people who live in remote mountain villages gather to build the Inca bridge of Q'eswachaka‚ a traditional structure of woven grass‚ and the last of its kind. This ancestral know-how inherited from the Incas‚ and the enduring spirit of community‚ enables the villagers to pull off a stunning feat of engineering‚ time and again.<br/>From 16.02.2025 19:30" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",The Inca Grass Bridge of Q'eswachaka (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (16.02.2025)
