#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Sciences - In brief" tvg-id="1038581192" tvg-name="The dominance of our species has consequences: we have created conditions that fuel rapid evolution. Global warming‚ climate change‚ hunting‚ habitat destruction‚ resource exploitation‚ and pollution are forcing nature to adapt to rapidly changing conditions.As a result‚ new variants emerge within populations or even entirely new species‚ adapting to new circumstances within a few generations. Ca.....<br/>From 09.07.2023 08:31" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",42: The Answer to Almost Everything - The Advent of Turbo-Evolution (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (09.07.2023)
